  "title": "Dominion Energy Charitable Foundation Fall Grant Cycle Now Open",
  "summary": "Grants support human needs, environmental stewardship, education and community vitality Cayce, S.C. (Aug. 12, 2026) – Nonprofit organizations within Dominion Energy's service areas are invited to apply for grants from the Dominion Energy Charitable Foundation. Grants will be awarded to support programs and specific projects that focus on human needs, environmental stewardship, education and community vitality. The foundation accepts grant requests during semiannual grant cycles. &nbs",
